  "description": "GameFrameX.Capability.Online.ServerLifecycle,GFX Online 区服生命周期能力包:开服锚点(ServerId 登记/开服日历/ServerOpened 能力事件)+ 合服原语(幂等可 dry-run 的归并计划/PlayerRoute 重指向/区服域行键重写/榜单封档/在途对局强制结算/资产归属列重写 + IServerMergeParticipant 玩法钩子)+ admin handlers(register_server_open/query_server_calendar/plan_server_merge/dry_run_server_merge/execute_server_merge). Server lifecycle capability package for the GFX Online family: server-open anchors with calendar and the ServerOpened capability event, plus idempotent dry-run-first server-merge primitives (merge plan, player-route repointing, server-domain row-key rewrite, leaderboard sealing, in-flight match settlement, asset home-server column rewrite) with the IServerMergeParticipant gameplay hook and admin handlers. Documentation: https://gameframex.doc.alianblank.com",
